Asset: bronze_minute_activity
Type: Data Set
Location: s3://fitbit-bronze-layer/minute_data/
Format: JSON (GZIP compressed)
Owner: Data Engineering Team
Classification: RAW / SENSITIVE

Columns:
→ user_id (STRING) - original device ID
→ timestamp (STRING) - raw format
→ steps (INTEGER) - raw steps
→ calories (DOUBLE) - raw calories
→ intensity (INTEGER) - raw intensity
→ sleep_value (INTEGER) - raw sleep
→ event_type (STRING) - minute_activity
→ source (STRING) - fitbit_simulator
→ ingest_time (TIMESTAMP) - load time

Quality Rules:
→ user_id NOT NULL
→ timestamp NOT NULL
→ steps BETWEEN 0 AND 200
→ calories BETWEEN 0 AND 20
→ intensity IN (0,1,2,3)

