Asset: silver_minute_activity
Type: Data Set
Location: s3://fitbit-silver-layer/minute_data/
Format: Parquet (Snappy compressed)
Owner: Data Engineering Team
Classification: PROCESSED / MASKED

Columns:
→ user_id (STRING) - SHA-256 masked
→ timestamp (TIMESTAMP) - ISO format
→ steps (INTEGER) - validated
→ calories (DOUBLE) - validated
→ intensity (INTEGER) - validated
→ sleep_value (INTEGER) - nullable
→ is_active (INTEGER) - derived
→ is_sleeping (INTEGER) - derived
→ hour_of_day (INTEGER) - derived
→ day_of_week (INTEGER) - derived
→ year (INTEGER) - partition key
→ month (INTEGER) - partition key
→ day (INTEGER) - partition key
→ processed_at (TIMESTAMP) - audit

Quality Rules:
→ user_id starts with "USR_"
→ timestamp IS NOT NULL
→ No duplicates (user_id + timestamp)
→ year BETWEEN 2016 AND 2026
